    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u25.d05.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Asking about and buying amounts",
        "ru": "Спрашиваем и покупаем количества"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "At the shop, ask \"How much…?\" (uncountable) or \"How many…?\" (plural), and buy amounts with containers and measures: \"a bottle of\", \"a kilo of\", \"a packet of\".",
        "ru": "В магазине спрашивай «How much…?» (неисчисляемое) или «How many…?» (мн. число) и покупай количества через ёмкости и меры: «a bottle of», «a kilo of», «a packet of»."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "How much / How many",
            "ru": "How much / How many"
          },
          "formula": "How much + uncountable · How many + plural",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "How much rice? How many apples?",
              "ru": "Сколько риса? Сколько яблок?"
            }
          ],
          "ref": "quantifiers-b1"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "a … of",
            "ru": "a … of"
          },
          "formula": "a bottle/kilo/packet + of + noun",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "A kilo of tomatoes, please.",
              "ru": "Килограмм помидоров, пожалуйста."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "quantifiers-b1"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "fewer / less",
            "ru": "fewer / less"
          },
          "formula": "fewer + plural · less + uncountable",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "fewer bags · less plastic",
              "ru": "меньше пакетов · меньше пластика"
            }
          ],
          "ref": "quantifiers-b1"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "\"How much\" + uncountable, \"How many\" + plural: \"How much bread?\", \"How many rolls?\"",
          "ru": "«How much» + неисч., «How many» + мн.: «How much bread?», «How many rolls?»"
        },
        {
          "en": "\"fewer\" for countable, \"less\" for uncountable: \"fewer bottles\", \"less water\".",
          "ru": "«fewer» — исчисляемое, «less» — неисчисляемое: «fewer bottles», «less water»."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u25.d05.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "At the market",
        "ru": "На рынке"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u25.d05.reading.b1",
          "en": "\"How much do we need?\" asked Leo at the market. \"A kilo of apples, a bottle of milk, and a loaf of bread,\" said his mum. \"And how many eggs?\" \"A dozen. Oh, and a jar of honey and a packet of tea.\"",
          "ru": "«Сколько нам нужно?» — спросил Лео на рынке. «Килограмм яблок, бутылку молока и буханку хлеба, — сказала мама. — И сколько яиц?» «Дюжину. Ах да, и банку мёда и пачку чая».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u25.d05.reading.b1.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u25.d05.reading.b2",
          "en": "\"That's plenty,\" Leo said. \"We're buying less sugar than last week, and fewer sweets too.\" His mum smiled. \"Good. We eat too many sweets anyway. A few pieces of fruit are much better.\"",
          "ru": "«Этого достаточно, — сказал Лео. — Сахара берём меньше, чем на прошлой неделе, и сладостей тоже меньше». Мама улыбнулась. «Хорошо. Мы и так едим слишком много сладкого. Несколько фруктов гораздо полезнее».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u25.d05.reading.b2.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
